OL,3,ASchoolboy knife attacker texted 'sorry'
OL,4,Ato mum
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a teenage boy who stabbed
OL,7,Fa girl in a masked attack at a school
OL,8,Fsaid she received a message from her
OL,9,Fson saying "sorry" shortly after the
OL,10,Fattack, a trial has heard.
OL,12,FPolice were called to Thorpe St Andrew
OL,13,FSchool, near Norwich, on 11 March
OL,14,Ffollowing reports a 15-year-old had
OL,15,Fbeen stabbed in the back.
OL,17,FThe defendant, who is 16 and cannot be
OL,18,Fnamed for legal reasons, denies
OL,19,Fattempted murder, but has admitted
OL,20,Fpossessing a kitchen knife without
OL,21,Flawful authority and wounding with
OL,22,Fintent.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
